					Hsch.
				</span></i>
			; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀ. πάγην</span>
			<i>spring</i> a trap that is set, <i><span class="en">
				Lyc.
				407
			</span></i>; <i>twang</i> a string, <i><span class="en">
